    "supervised": "Four 64-start training campaigns (315644101,131664001,1147055331,215668375), with skip12 guiding four/two/one/zero of each four five-decision blocks. Label all 14 outputs with the original guide and source actor, including near waypoints. Extend 48 feed-forward units to 96 with zero initial outgoing weights. Fit balanced map-cell and heading bins; all three snapshots missed both seats. Separate successful-route experiments target five decisions of displacement or reflect horizontal trajectories. Their snapshots also missed the selection cohort.",
